#                     are running (GameEventFeature, docs/areas/game-events-weather.md). Default
#                     none: an operator override for a world that runs no event service or wants an
#                     event forced on for its conditions only.
#        Type: uint[]
#        Default: (empty list)
#        Allowed: a list: numbered keys 0, 1, 2, ...; each value is a whole number, 0 to 4294967295
#        Reload: Start-up (read once when the daemon starts)
#        Docs: docs/reference/configuration.md#conditions
#
# Empty by default.
# Conditions.ActiveGameEvents.0 =

