#    ItemRandomProperties.EnchantmentTemplateDumpPath
#        Description: A MySQL world dump (vmangos or cmangos classic-db, plain or .gz) holding
#                     item_enchantment_template; only that table is read. Both this and DbcPath are
#                     needed for random properties. A configured dump that cannot be read refuses
#                     startup.
#        Type: string
#        Default: (not set)
#        Allowed: text
#        Reload: Start-up (read once when the daemon starts)
